    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "c2_body",
      "x": 54,
      "y": 290,
      "width": 251,
      "height": 110,
      "text": "Armed with these recovered boundary\nlines, static and dynamic codebase\nprofiling begins. Extracting abstract\nsyntax trees and mining runtime\ninvariants\u2014such as pointer lifetimes\nand memory layouts\u2014determines\nidiomatic target equivalents and\ndefines the global migration strategy.",
      "originalText": "Armed with these recovered boundary\nlines, static and dynamic codebase\nprofiling begins. Extracting abstract\nsyntax trees and mining runtime\ninvariants\u2014such as pointer lifetimes\nand memory layouts\u2014determines\nidiomatic target equivalents and\ndefines the global migration strategy.",
      "fontSize": 11,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "strokeColor": "#495057",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "baseline": 9
    },
