    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "c3_body",
      "x": 54,
      "y": 430,
      "width": 251,
      "height": 110,
      "text": "These profiles and invariant models\nform the foundation for structural\ndecomposition. Breaking monolithic\nfiles into dependency-ordered syntax\nfragments resolves cyclic imports\nthrough reverse-topological scheduling\nand generates compilable skeleton\ntargets to anchor translated logic.",
