    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "c4_body",
      "x": 54,
      "y": 575,
      "width": 245,
      "height": 110,
      "text": "With the skeleton scaffolds in place,\nchunked code translation commences.\nTranslating one scheduled fragment at\na time while threading a rolling\nsymbol table and querying active\nlanguage servers produces type-safe\ntarget implementations that remain\nglobally synchronized.",
      "originalText": "With the skeleton scaffolds in place,\nchunked code translation commences.\nTranslating one scheduled fragment at\na time while threading a rolling\nsymbol table and querying active\nlanguage servers produces type-safe\ntarget implementations that remain\nglobally synchronized.",
