    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "c5_body",
      "x": 1444,
      "y": 150,
      "width": 245,
      "height": 124,
      "text": "Before newly translated source code\nreaches compiler toolchains, it\nundergoes adversarial inspection.\nPrompting an independent model with a\nstrict auditor persona intercepts\nhallucinated APIs, phantom type\nsignatures, and subtle syntax drifts\nthat generative models routinely\nproduce.",
