    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "c7_body",
      "x": 1444,
      "y": 575,
      "width": 251,
      "height": 110,
      "text": "When compiler diagnostics show errors\nor semantic doubts emerge, an\nindependent judge panel convenes.\nComparing runtime execution traces and\nedge-case behavior between source and\ntarget programs quantifies behavioral\nequivalence and identifies semantic\ndiscrepancies.",
      "originalText": "When compiler diagnostics show errors\nor semantic doubts emerge, an\nindependent judge panel convenes.\nComparing runtime execution traces and\nedge-case behavior between source and\ntarget programs quantifies behavioral\nequivalence and identifies semantic\ndiscrepancies.",
